    "snippet": "Jul 15, 2026         The CISA Known Exploited Vulnerabilities catalog received four new entries on July 14, 2026. These additions reflect active exploitation in the wild and demand prompt attention from security teams responsible for enterprise infrastructure. The catalog is updated regularly to reflect the current threat landscape and focuses resources on confirmed risks rather than theoretical ones.   Summarize",
